# --- MISTAKE AND FIX ------------------------------------------------
# The upload above flashed a STALE binary. 'esphome upload' uploads the
# last binary that was built; it does not recompile. That image had been
# built days earlier with placeholder secrets, so the device booted and
# tried to join an SSID named 'validation-only' that does not exist.
# Use 'esphome run' (compile + upload), or compile explicitly first.

